= render 'shared/breakthrough_page', page_title: 'Busk Board', current_page: 'Busk Board', page_subtitle: 'Big buttons on your phone or tablet to trigger CunningFX and DMX presets live', document_title: 'Busk Board - Live Control Breakthrough', meta: ['Mobile & tablet', 'CunningFX triggers', 'DMX presets'], toc: busk_board_toc do
  p.lead Sometimes you just want to walk the room with a tablet and mash big colourful buttons — Busk Board turns your phone or tablet into a live control surface for CunningFX and DMX presets.

  .prose
    section#what-is-busk-board
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Overview
        | What is Busk Board?

      p
        | Busk Board is a built-in page on your Baldrick board that lays out configurable buttons on a mobile or tablet screen. Tap a button to fire
        = link_to ' CunningFX', breakthroughs_cunningfx_path
        |  presets or DMX presets on a
        = link_to ' BaldrickDMX', board_path('baldrickdmx')
        |  — moving heads, fog, bubbles, the lot.
      p It's aimed at busking: walking the show, reacting to the crowd, and changing looks on the fly without diving back into the full web interface.

      .callout.info
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"
            path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"
        div
          span.lbl Built for fingers
          p.bd Large touch targets, phone- and tablet-friendly layout — open it on the device in your hand and start triggering.

    section#how-it-works
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Live
        | How it works

      p Open Busk Board from your board's web interface on a phone or tablet. Configure which buttons map to which CunningFX or DMX presets, then use the page as your live surface while the show runs.

      .spec-grid
        .spec
          span.ic
            svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
              rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"
              path d="M12 18h.01"
          h4 Phone or tablet
          p Use the device you're already carrying — no extra hardware required.
        .spec
          span.ic
            svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
              path d="M12 2l3 7h7l-5.5 4.5L18 21l-6-4-6 4 1.5-7.5L2 9h7z"
          h4 CunningFX
          p Trigger layered effect presets with a single tap.
        .spec
          span.ic
            svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
              circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"
              path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4"
          h4 DMX presets
          p Fire BaldrickDMX presets for fixtures and effects gear.
        .spec
          span.ic
            svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
              path d="M4 12h16M6 8l-4 4 4 4M18 8l4 4-4 4"
          h4 Busk-friendly
          p React in the moment — walk the room and change looks as you go.

    section#inspiration
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Inspiration
        | Inspiration

      p
        | Inspired by the excellent Big Button plugin by
        = link_to ' Chris Pinkham', 'https://github.com/cpinkham', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener'
        | .
      p Chris's Big Button plugin showed how powerful a simple grid of oversized controls can be for live shows. Busk Board brings that same idea into the Baldrick web interface so you can busk CunningFX and DMX presets from the device in your pocket.

    h2
      span.hk
        span.bar
        span.annot Keep reading
      | Related breakthroughs

    .next-grid
      = link_to breakthroughs_cunningfx_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Breakthrough
          span.go →
        h4 CunningFX
        p The effects engine Busk Board is built to trigger.
      = link_to breakthroughs_turniput_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Breakthrough
          span.go →
        h4 Turniput
        p Physical buttons and sensors when you want hardware triggers.
      = link_to board_path('baldrickdmx'), class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Docs
          span.go →
        h4 BaldrickDMX
        p DMX presets you can fire from Busk Board.
      = link_to breakthroughs_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Index
          span.go →
        h4 All breakthroughs
        p Explore everything that makes Baldrick boards a bit special.

section.cta
  .wrap
    h2 Busk the room
    p Open Busk Board on your phone or tablet and trigger CunningFX or DMX presets with a tap.
    .cta-btns
      = link_to breakthroughs_cunningfx_path, class: 'btn btn-bone' do
        | Meet CunningFX
        span.ar →
      = link_to breakthroughs_path, class: 'btn btn-clear' do
